<b>Okay...</b>

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.740
<b>No, Madoka!</b>

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.700
<b>Don't run along the poolside. It's dangerous!</b>

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.790
<b><i>Kamo Girls!</i></b>

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.000
<b><i>Fight, fight, fight, fight!</i></b>

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.960
<b><i>Kamo Girls!</i></b>

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.250
<b><i>Fight, fight, fight, fight!</i></b>

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.080
<b><i>Kamo Girls!</i></b>

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.420
<b>Here...</b>

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.930
<b>Got it.</b>

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.720
<b>Hey, stop it!</b>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.390
<b>No, get off me!</b>

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:37.440
<b>My brother will lecture me if he sees me like this!</b>

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.150
<b>Hey, come on!</b>

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:44.570
<b>Don't just sit up there! Help us out, Ms. Machiko!</b>

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.700
<b>Say, Kyouno.</b>

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.620
<b>Yes?</b>

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.120
<b>Tell me...</b>

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.250
<b>Where's your jersey?</b>

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.670
<b>And your signature topknot?</b>

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.090
<b>What happened?</b>

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.840
<b>I'm just curious.</b>

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.680
<b>Did you leave it behind somewhere?</b>

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.430
<b>Your Jersey Club spirit, that is.</b>

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:13.310
<b>Oh, not you too, Ms. Machiko.</b>

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.690
<b>I already have Muginami telling me weird stuff about...</b>

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.440
<b><i>You haven't considered my feelings in the least!</i></b>

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.570
<b><i>No one asked you to get revenge for me!</i></b>

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.570
<b>Oh no...</b>

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:27.070
<b>Madoka?</b>

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.870
<b>I wasn't listening to her.</b>

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.200
<b>Muginami was telling me how she felt all along.</b>

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.750
<b>You know the drill, right?</b>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.710
<b>If you realize that you were wrong...</b>

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.670
<b>Apologize right away!</b>

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.040
<b>When you make up your mind...</b>

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.210
<b>Act on it!</b>

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.380
<b>But finish this job first, okay?</b>

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.260
<b>Lan, how many are left?</b>

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.850
<b>Huh? Um... one more.</b>

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.020
<b>Madoka! Watch out!</b>

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.110
<b>Madoka?!</b>

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.900
<b>Score!</b>

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.200
<b>I don't have any spare bra and panties, but I have to put on my jerseys!</b>

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:07.990
<b>Wait, Madoka!</b>

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.160
<b>I can't!</b>

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:13.290
<b>She didn't care if Villagiuvio hated her, Muginami still wished to protect him!</b>

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:12.700
<b>Almost!</b>

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.000
<b>That means Muginami was full of Jersey Club spirit!</b>

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.460
<b>And I just picked a fight with him, forgetting what was most important!</b>

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.790
<b>I have to get back to Pharos and tell her!</b>

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>Muginami, I...!</b>

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>Madoka, listen...!</b>

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.770
<b>Um... You first, Madoka.</b>

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.230
<b>Huh? Uh... Well... Hmm...</b>

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.360
<b>You see... Uh...</b>

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:54.950
<b>Taking a nice hot bath at home is definitely better than using the showers at school.</b>

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.790
<b>You know, I never took a bath when I was a child.</b>

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>Huh?</b>

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.460
<b>A place where all the garbage, trash, hatred</b>

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:07.920
<b>and despair in the universe end up.</b>

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.800
<b>That's the kind of place Planet U-Go, my birthplace, was like.</b>

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.430
<b>There was only winter.</b>

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.890
<b>A thick cloud endlessly hung over our heads.</b>

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.400
<b>It was a monochrome land.</b>

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.280
<b>Huh?</b>

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.950
<b>Aren't you going to take a bath with them?</b>

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:39.620
<b>Really? Then would you mind bringing them towels?</b>

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.960
<b>No one trusted each other.</b>

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.380
<b>We were all desperate to protect our own selves.</b>

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.970
<b>It was all we could do to survive.</b>

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.340
<b>As far back as I could remember, I'd only known suffering.</b>

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:58.220
<b>I didn't know there was anything else in this world.</b>

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.020
<b>Until I met him.</b>

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.480
<b>Villangiulion?{lol Eva}</b>

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.400
<b>Villagiulio...</b>

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:11.490
<b>He taught me how to smile.</b>

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.490
<b>How to be happy, to be sad...</b>

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.410
<b>How to love someone...</b>

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:22.120
<b>He was the only reason I kept on living.</b>

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.420
<b>That's why I...</b>

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.710
<b>I'm sorry, Madoka!</b>

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.600
<b>I should be saying that.</b>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.860
<b>I'm sorry, Muginami.</b>

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Where are you going?</b>

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.970
<b>Do you have somewhere to go to?</b>

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.260
<b>It's none of your business, Lan.</b>

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.020
<b>Yes, it is.</b>

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.980
<b>I'm the princess of the planet that deposed Villagiulio.</b>

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.860
<b>I don't expect you to accept me.</b>

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.400
<b>But Madoka is different.</b>

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:18.240
<b>Don't hurt her feelings by leaving without a word!</b>

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.490
<b>Don't you know that you're already like family to her?</b>

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:25.080
<b>There's no way she would...</b>

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.000
<b>You are family, Muginami!</b>

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.540
<b>We live under the same roof and share our meals.</b>

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.800
<b>We've slept side-by-side and taken a bath together!</b>

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.380
<b>Of course you're family!</b>

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.260
<b>Are you listening, Muginami?</b>

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.060
<b>But I did such a terrible thing!</b>

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.390
<b>Madoka, Lan, to both of you...</b>

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:55.860
<b>Can I really stay in this town with you two?</b>

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.610
<b>Is it really okay?!</b>

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.490
<b>Of course!</b>

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.330
<b>That's why these are my words too.</b>

