00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.880
<b>Thank you for becoming part of my family.</b>

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:36.150
<b>But... I didn't get to take a bath.</b>

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:36.980
<b>Huh?</b>

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:42.110
<b>To be honest, I wanted to take a bath with you too.</b>

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:43.530
<b>Come again?</b>

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.240
<b>In...</b>

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:50.960
<b>In Le Garite, when someone becomes part of your family, everyone must take a bath together!</b>

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.290
<b>I don't think that's true.</b>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.580
<b>Yes, it is!</b>

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.170
<b>I, Princess Laffinty, made the rule!</b>

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:57.340
<b>I decided it just this minute!</b>

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.710
<b>So the three of us... have to bathe together!</b>

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:06.930
<b>Isn't going completely nude here a little too bold?</b>

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.810
<b>No, it's not.</b>

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:13.310
<b>Let's do it right now!</b>

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.520
<b>Look.</b>

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.400
<b>We have a huge bathtub right here.</b>

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.610
<b>I'm going in...</b>

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.740
<b>First!</b>

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.950
<b>Yay!</b>

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.490
<b>Well then,</b>

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.660
<b>I'm going in second!</b>

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.580
<b>Hey! Wait for me!</b>

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.460
<b>Here I come!</b>

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.270
<b>Oh, how cute!</b>

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.650
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.280
<b>Well, you're all working so hard.</b>

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.240
<b>Take it as a token of my appreciation.</b>

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.660
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.200
<b>You expect us to wear this at work?</b>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.410
<b>It's so embarrassing!</b>

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.370
<b>That's not true, Madoka!</b>

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.040
<b>You look like a waitress!</b>

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.040
<b>Huh?</b>

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>Y-You think so?</b>

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.250
<b>I'm a bit embarrassed, too.</b>

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.840
<b>It doesn't suit you very well.</b>

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.760
<b>Maybe I shouldn't have stopped you from leaving.</b>

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:28.800
<b>I mean, you have to have the right curves in the right places.</b>

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.640
<b>Hey, what're you doing?</b>

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.560
<b>There... That's more like it, huh?</b>

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:42.900
<b>Hey, what about breakfast?</b>

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:43.900
<b>We'll just take this!</b>

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.450
<b>We're off!</b>

